[0.001, "o", "ccess it SHALL respond `201` with the group's server-generated `id`, `name`, and `members` (each with server-g\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22menerated `id` and `name`), in the order the members were added.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +60 lines \r\u001b[2B⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=nj4tcf;file:///Users/maryam/Workspace/sdd-bake-off/frameworks/openspec/openspec/changes/add-expense-splitting-api/specs/expense-recording/spec.md\u0007openspec/changes/add-expense-splitting-api/specs/expense-recording/spec.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=i8m5ul;file:///Users/maryam/Workspace/sdd-bake-off/frameworks/openspec/openspec/changes/add-expense-splitting-api/specs/balance-settlement/spec.md\u0007openspec/changes/add-expense-splitting-api/specs/balance-settlement/spec.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;228;144;112mNucleating…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(running PreToolUse hook · 1m 24s · ↓\u001b[53G8.6k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting "]
